/T (In deep learning, autoencoders are a type of neural network that can compress and reconstruct data. An autoencoder is a type of artificial neural network used to learn efficient coding of unlabelled data \(unsupervised learning\). An autoencoder learns two functions: an encoding function that transforms the input data, and a decoding function that recreates the input data from the encoded representation. )
/E (In deep learning, autoencoders are a type of neural network that can compress and reconstruct data. An autoencoder is a type of artificial neural network used to learn efficient coding of unlabelled data \(unsupervised learning\). An autoencoder learns two functions: an encoding function that transforms the input data, and a decoding function that recreates the input data from the encoded representation. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [22]
>>
